// Notation: $Q^{LCB}_c=\min(Q_1,Q_2)-c\,|Q_1-Q_2|$.
// 1. Action selection: if $|Q_1(s,\pi)-Q_2(s,\pi)|<0.5$, take $a=\pi(s)+0.03\,a_{\max}\,\hat g$ with $g=\nabla_a Q^{LCB}_{0.1}(s,a)$, else $a=\pi(s)$; add Gaussian exploration noise.
// 2. Critic targets: $y=r+\gamma(1-d)\,Q^{LCB}_{0.25}(s',\tilde\pi(s'))$ with TD3 noise $\sigma=0.2$, clip $0.5$.
// 3. Critic update: MSE on $(Q_1,y)$ and $(Q_2,y)$.
// 4. Every policy_frequency steps:
//    a. Compute advantage $A=\mathrm{clip}((Q^{LCB}_{0.1}(s,a)-Q^{LCB}_{0.1}(s,\pi))/2.5,-8,8)$.
//    b. Trust $w=0.05\,\sigma(A)$.
//    c. Actor loss $=-\overline{Q^{LCB}_{0.1}(s,\pi)}+\overline{w\,(\pi-a)^2}$.
// 5. Soft-update target actor (delayed) and both target critics every step.
